{
  "id": "lesson-prep-v1",
  "name": "备课主流程",
  "version": 6,
  "description": "师者工作台的备课线：先从老师原话里取年级、学科、课题（取不到才追问），再跑学情档案子流拿分层与易错点，目标、活动、评价三路并行产出，交付校验员检查目标覆盖与课时守恒，不合格回环重写最多两轮，通过后由教案节点流式写成可读教案。",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "name": "question",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "老师这一轮的原话；年级、学科、课题、课时都从这里识别"
    },
    {
      "name": "grade",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "学段年级，显式传入时以它为准"
    },
    {
      "name": "subject",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "学科，显式传入时以它为准"
    },
    {
      "name": "topic",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "课题，显式传入时以它为准"
    },
    {
      "name": "minutes",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "课时长度，默认 40 分钟"
    },
    {
      "name": "objectives",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "教师给定的教学目标，可不填"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "kind": "start",
      "title": "开始"
    },
    {
      "id": "intake",
      "kind": "extract",
      "title": "备课要素提取",
      "description": "从老师原话里取年级、学科、课题和课时；显式传进来的同名输入优先，真取不到的才挂卡片追问一次。",
      "inputs": {
        "question": "${input.question}",
        "grade": "${input.grade}",
        "subject": "${input.subject}",
        "topic": "${input.topic}"
      },
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "grade",
          "label": "学段年级",
          "description": "如 初三、五年级、高二；原话只写「初三数学」时取 初三",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "question": "这节备课是哪个年级的？比如「初三」「五年级」。"
        },
        {
          "name": "subject",
          "label": "学科",
          "description": "如 数学、语文、英语",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "question": "这节备课是哪门学科？"
        },
        {
          "name": "topic",
          "label": "课题",
          "description": "这一节课要讲的具体内容，如 一元二次方程的解法、分数的意义",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "question": "这一节课要讲哪个课题？比如「一元二次方程的解法」。"
        },
        {
          "name": "minutes",
          "label": "课时长度",
          "description": "如 40 分钟、45 分钟；没提就留空用默认",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        }
      ],
      "prompt": "从老师原话里提取备课要素。规则：\n1. 只提取原话中明确出现的值，不要替老师编造年级或课题。\n2. 「帮我备一节初三数学一元二次方程的课」→ grade=初三、subject=数学、topic=一元二次方程。\n3. 原话只给了学段（如「初中数学」）就填对应学段，不要补成具体年级。\n4. 课时没提就留空，不要猜。",
      "maxRounds": 3,
      "onMissing": "fail"
    },
    {
      "id": "ready",
      "kind": "template",
      "title": "要点回执",
      "description": "把从原话里认出来的关键要素回显一句，让老师确认没理解偏，同时说明接下来在做什么。",
      "emitOutput": true,
      "streamOutput": true,
      "template": "已确认：${intake.grade}${intake.subject}《${intake.topic}》\n正在做学情分层和活动设计，教案随后出全文。\n\n",
      "stubOutput": {
        "output": "已确认要素，正在处理。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "profile",
      "kind": "subworkflow",
      "title": "学情档案分析",
      "workflowId": "td-class-profile-v1",
      "inputs": {
        "grade": "${intake.grade}",
        "subject": "${intake.subject}",
        "topic": "${intake.topic}"
      },
      "outputs": {
        "tiers": "${analyse.output.tiers}",
        "misconceptions": "${analyse.output.misconceptions}",
        "followUps": "${analyse.output.followUps}",
        "students": "${filter.output.students}"
      },
      "stubOutput": {
        "tiers": [
          {
            "level": "扎实",
            "students": [
              "周语桐"
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "分数单元 85 左右"
            ]
          },
          {
            "level": "波动",
            "students": [
              "赵一鸣"
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "78-85，应用题波动大"
            ]
          },
          {
            "level": "薄弱",
            "students": [
              "黄子轩",
              "林小满"
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "58、61 与 63、68"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "misconceptions": [
          "分子分母越大分数越大",
          "分子分母含义颠倒",
          "单位「1」变化时找不到整体"
        ],
        "followUps": [
          "黄子轩：折纸建立等量概念",
          "林小满：先画图再写符号"
        ],
        "students": [
          {
            "id": "huangzx",
            "name": "黄子轩",
            "average": 59.5,
            "tags": [
              "数学"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "linxm",
            "name": "林小满",
            "average": 65.5,
            "tags": [
              "数学",
              "心理"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "zhaoym",
            "name": "赵一鸣",
            "average": 81.5,
            "tags": [
              "数学"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "zhouyt",
            "name": "周语桐",
            "average": 85.5,
            "tags": [
              "安全",
              "心理"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "design",
      "kind": "parallel",
      "title": "目标活动评价并行",
      "branches": [
        {
          "id": "goal",
          "kind": "agent",
          "title": "目标拆解",
          "agent": "td-goal-designer",
          "outputFormat": "json",
          "outputContract": {
            "required": [
              "objectives"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": {
            "grade": "${intake.grade}",
            "subject": "${intake.subject}",
            "topic": "${intake.topic}",
            "givenObjectives": "${input.objectives}",
            "misconceptions": "${profile.misconceptions}"
          },
          "stubOutput": {
            "objectives": [
              {
                "dimension": "知识与技能",
                "text": "能举例说明 3/4 的含义",
                "observable": "能说出整体与份数",
                "linkedIssue": "分子分母含义颠倒"
              },
              {
                "dimension": "过程与方法",
                "text": "能把 12 个苹果看作单位「1」平均分组",
                "observable": "能画出分组图并写出分数",
                "linkedIssue": "单位「1」变化时找不到整体"
              }
            ]
          },
          "model": "qwen-flash"
        },
        {
          "id": "activity",
          "kind": "agent",
          "title": "活动设计",
          "agent": "td-activity-designer",
          "outputFormat": "json",
          "outputContract": {
            "required": [
              "activities"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": {
            "topic": "${intake.topic}",
            "minutes": "${intake.minutes}",
            "tiers": "${profile.tiers}",
            "misconceptions": "${profile.misconceptions}"
          },
          "stubOutput": {
            "activities": [
              {
                "phase": "导入",
                "minutes": 5,
                "teacher": "分 4 张纸给 2 人",
                "students": "说出每人得到多少",
                "objective": "单位「1」",
                "tiering": "全体"
              },
              {
                "phase": "探究",
                "minutes": 15,
                "teacher": "8 个圆片分 4 份再换 12 个",
                "students": "画图并写分数",
                "objective": "分数意义",
                "tiering": "薄弱档用实物，扎实档直接抽象"
              },
              {
                "phase": "对比",
                "minutes": 8,
                "teacher": "组织折纸验证 1/2 与 2/4",
                "students": "折纸并说理由",
                "objective": "等值分数",
                "tiering": "全体"
              },
              {
                "phase": "巩固",
                "minutes": 8,
                "teacher": "发三层练习",
                "students": "按层做题",
                "objective": "分层达标",
                "tiering": "三层"
              },
              {
                "phase": "小结",
                "minutes": 4,
                "teacher": "回扣目标",
                "students": "一句话说分数含义",
                "objective": "目标回扣",
                "tiering": "全体"
              }
            ]
          },
          "model": "qwen-flash"
        },
        {
          "id": "assessment",
          "kind": "agent",
          "title": "分层评价",
          "agent": "td-assessment-designer",
          "outputFormat": "json",
          "outputContract": {
            "required": [
              "items"
            ]
          },
          "inputs": {
            "topic": "${intake.topic}",
            "misconceptions": "${profile.misconceptions}",
            "tiers": "${profile.tiers}"
          },
          "stubOutput": {
            "items": [
              {
                "tier": "基础",
                "stem": "把 8 个圆片平均分成 4 份，每份是整体的几分之几",
                "answer": "1/4",
                "rubric": "写出 1/4 且圈出整体得满分",
                "objective": "分数意义",
                "misconception": "单位「1」"
              },
              {
                "tier": "提高",
                "stem": "举例说明 3/5 的含义并画图",
                "answer": "整体分 5 份取 3 份",
                "rubric": "文字说明与图形一致",
                "objective": "分数表述",
                "misconception": "分子分母颠倒"
              },
              {
                "tier": "挑战",
                "stem": "整体的 1/3 是否可能小于另一个整体的 1/2",
                "answer": "可能，整体不同",
                "rubric": "举出反例得满分",
                "objective": "单位「1」相对性",
                "misconception": "分母越大分数越小"
              }
            ]
          },
          "model": "qwen-flash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "kind": "agent",
      "title": "完整性校验",
      "agent": "td-lesson-reviewer",
      "outputFormat": "json",
      "outputContract": {
        "required": [
          "passed",
          "issues"
        ]
      },
      "inputs": {
        "objectives": "${goal.output.objectives}",
        "activities": "${activity.output.activities}",
        "items": "${assessment.output.items}",
        "minutes": "${intake.minutes}"
      },
      "stubOutput": {
        "passed": false,
        "issues": [
          {
            "detail": "易错点「分子分母越大分数越大」未在活动中安排针对性对比",
            "where": "activity.activities"
          }
        ],
        "coverage": {
          "objectiveCovered": 2,
          "activityCount": 5,
          "itemCount": 3,
          "minutesSum": 40
        }
      },
      "model": "qwen-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "review-gate",
      "kind": "condition",
      "title": "校验不过闸门",
      "when": "${review.output.passed} == false",
      "then": [
        {
          "id": "rewrite-loop",
          "kind": "loop",
          "title": "活动重写循环",
          "maxIterations": 2,
          "while": "${recheck.output.passed} == false",
          "patience": 2,
          "budget": {
            "maxDurationMs": 180000,
            "maxTokens": 0
          },
          "body": [
            {
              "id": "rewrite",
              "kind": "agent",
              "title": "针对问题重写活动",
              "agent": "td-activity-designer",
              "outputFormat": "json",
              "inputs": {
                "issues": "${review.output.issues}",
                "activities": "${activity.output.activities}",
                "minutes": "${intake.minutes}"
              },
              "stubOutput": {
                "activities": [
                  {
                    "phase": "导入",
                    "minutes": 5,
                    "teacher": "分 4 张纸给 2 人",
                    "students": "说出每人得到多少",
                    "objective": "单位「1」",
                    "tiering": "全体"
                  },
                  {
                    "phase": "探究",
                    "minutes": 15,
                    "teacher": "8 个圆片分 4 份再换 12 个",
                    "students": "画图并写分数",
                    "objective": "分数意义",
                    "tiering": "薄弱档用实物，扎实档直接抽象"
                  },
                  {
                    "phase": "对比",
                    "minutes": 10,
                    "teacher": "用 1/2 与 1/3 反例说明分母大不一定分数大，再折纸验证 1/2=2/4",
                    "students": "举例并说理由",
                    "objective": "分数大小与等值",
                    "tiering": "全体"
                  },
                  {
                    "phase": "巩固",
                    "minutes": 6,
                    "teacher": "发三层练习",
                    "students": "按层做题",
                    "objective": "分层达标",
                    "tiering": "三层"
                  },
                  {
                    "phase": "小结",
                    "minutes": 4,
                    "teacher": "回扣目标",
                    "students": "一句话说分数含义",
                    "objective": "目标回扣",
                    "tiering": "全体"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "model": "qwen-flash"
            },
            {
              "id": "recheck",
              "kind": "agent",
              "title": "再校验",
              "agent": "td-lesson-reviewer",
              "outputFormat": "json",
              "inputs": {
                "objectives": "${goal.output.objectives}",
                "activities": "${rewrite.output.activities}",
                "items": "${assessment.output.items}"
              },
              "stubOutput": {
                "passed": true,
                "issues": [],
                "coverage": {
                  "objectiveCovered": 2,
                  "activityCount": 5,
                  "itemCount": 3,
                  "minutesSum": 40
                }
              },
              "model": "qwen-flash"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "finalize",
      "kind": "llm",
      "title": "教案定稿",
      "description": "把学情、目标、活动、评价整理成老师能直接照着上的教案正文，流式打印到会话。",
      "emitOutput": true,
      "streamOutput": true,
      "temperature": 0.4,
      "maxTokens": 4096,
      "inputs": {
        "grade": "${intake.grade}",
        "subject": "${intake.subject}",
        "topic": "${intake.topic}",
        "minutes": "${intake.minutes}",
        "tiers": "${profile.tiers}",
        "misconceptions": "${profile.misconceptions}",
        "objectives": "${goal.output.objectives}",
        "activities": "${activity.output.activities}",
        "items": "${assessment.output.items}",
        "recheck": "${recheck.output}",
        "question": "${input.question}"
      },
      "system": "你是带过多届毕业班的教研员。把给定的学情、目标、活动、评价写成一份老师能直接照着上课的教案。只写教案本身，不解释你的写法，不输出 JSON。",
      "prompt": "【老师原话】\n${input.question}\n\n【年级】${intake.grade}【学科】${intake.subject}【课题】${intake.topic}【课时】${intake.minutes}\n\n【学情分层】${profile.tiers}\n【易错点】${profile.misconceptions}\n【教学目标】${goal.output.objectives}\n【教学环节】${activity.output.activities}\n【分层评价】${assessment.output.items}\n\n把上面这些整理成教案正文，用 Markdown，按这个顺序写：\n1. 课题与课时（一行说清年级、学科、课题、时长）\n2. 学情起点（两三句，点出分层和易错点，不要罗列人名清单）\n3. 教学目标（分条，动词开头，可观察可检测）\n4. 教学过程（用表格：环节｜时长｜教师动作｜学生活动｜对应目标；总时长要和课时对得上）\n5. 分层作业（基础/提高/挑战各一道，写清题目与判定标准）\n6. 板书与提醒（板书结构 + 两个最容易翻车的点）\n\n写的时候直接引用易错点的原话，让老师一眼看出这堂课在防哪个坑。篇幅控制在 900–1300 字，不要客套开场白。\n\n直接输出正文：不要用 ``` 或 ```markdown 把整段回答包进代码块，第一行就写正文。",
      "stubOutput": {
        "output": "【课题】五年级数学《分数的意义》，40 分钟\n\n## 学情起点\n班里分三档……"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "kind": "end",
      "title": "结束",
      "inputs": {
        "text": "${finalize.output}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "start",
      "to": "intake"
    },
    {
      "from": "ready",
      "to": "profile"
    },
    {
      "from": "profile",
      "to": "design"
    },
    {
      "from": "design",
      "to": "review"
    },
    {
      "from": "review",
      "to": "review-gate"
    },
    {
      "from": "review-gate",
      "to": "finalize"
    },
    {
      "from": "finalize",
      "to": "end"
    },
    {
      "from": "intake",
      "to": "ready"
    }
  ]
}
